flowchart TB
    A[Agents] --> IG[Ingest Gateway]
    IG --> VQ[Validator and Quota]
    VQ --> K[(Kafka)]

    K --> SP[Stream Processor]
    SP --> HT[(Hot TSDB)]
    SP --> AE[Alert Evaluator]
    SP --> RP[Rollup Pipeline]

    HT <--> QS[Query Service]
    QS --> D[Dashboards]

    RP --> CS[(Cold Store)]
    CS --> QS
